    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The long-term goal of the Project is to improve the system of protection, promotion and realization of human rights, to ensure gender equality in Turkmenistan in accordance with UN conventions in the field of human rights, to assist the Ombudsman&apos;s Office in accreditation by the Global Alliance of National Human Rights Institutions (GANHRI) and membership of the APF.</narrative>
    </description>
